#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_user_lookup.html.heex:16
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Last Seen runs the Whowas lookup for recently disconnected users and shows when they left, which channels they were in, and their quit message when one was recorded."
msgstr "「最後上線」會對最近斷線的使用者執行 Whowas 查詢,顯示他們離開的時間、所在的頻道,以及有記錄時的離線訊息。"

