#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_perform.html.heex:2
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "The Perform system lets you define commands that execute automatically every time you connect. Channels are handled separately, in Auto-Join."
msgstr "自動執行功能可讓你定義每次連線時自動執行的指令。頻道則另外在自動加入中處理。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/feature_auto_join_channels.html.heex:75
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
